---
alwaysApply: true
---
Every page should be frontend only because the site will be exported in the end
Please use skills like make-interface-feel-better or responsive-design when designing or ask the user for more context
For each text that we enter in a page it needs to be saved in dictionaries/en.json (English copy constants)
Use Lucide-react for icons
Use motion for animations
When you add new sections or content, add the English strings to dictionaries/en.json
Dont put a ton of styling on something if that something can be used somewhere else or can be in the globals.css, try to be pragmatic and organized
The pages should be able to be exported for a client side page only, so basically it will be MPA CLIENT-SIDE and will only connect to the backend
